# Explicit root-level configuration exception for onnxruntime-node.
# onnxruntime-node is pulled in as a transitive node dependency of kokoro-js (via @huggingface/transformers).
# Roundset runs Kokoro strictly in the browser via WebGPU/WASM and never requires native Node.js CUDA GPU binaries.
# On Linux CI runners (e.g. GitHub Actions ubuntu-latest), onnxruntime-node's postinstall script attempts to download
# unbundled CUDA binaries from a 404 URL unless this flag is provided.
# This flag skips only the unused CUDA binary download and does not weaken integrity, authentication, or audit checks.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
